{"id":"658224","name":"白灼包菜","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/658224/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"包菜","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小米椒","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"包菜。","img":"images/658224/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"手撕成块，再清洗干净。","img":"images/658224/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"碗中放入蒜末和小米椒丝。","img":"images/658224/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"浇入热油。","img":"images/658224/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入酱油、陈醋、白糖，调成白灼汁备用。","img":"images/658224/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中水烧开，加入油和盐。","img":"images/658224/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入包菜焯水2分钟。","img":"images/658224/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"捞出装盘，浇入白灼汁即可。","img":"images/658224/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658224/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}